# Baselines directory for visual regression screenshots.

# To regenerate baselines:
#   1. Start the server: ./claw-code-go web --addr 127.0.0.1:7777
#   2. Remove old baselines: rm -f web/e2e/baselines/*.png
#   3. Run: npx playwright test web/e2e/mobile.spec.ts
#   4. The first run will fail, saving new baselines to this directory.
#   5. Visually review each .png in this directory.
#   6. Run again: npx playwright test web/e2e/mobile.spec.ts
#   7. This time the tests should pass against the new baselines.
#
# Baselines must be committed to git after verification.